8892888,2024-05-01,Student loan,Private student loan,Dealing with your lender or servicer,Don't agree with the fees charged,"I attended XXXX XXXX from XX/XX/XXXX - XX/XX/XXXX. This complaint is for loans associated with that school held by Navient. 

