Furthermore, under 15 U.S. Code 1681s2 ( A ) ( XXXX ) and XXXX, entities are expressly prohibited from furnishing inaccurate information to consumer reporting agencies. These sections also require the maintenance of reasonable procedures to avoid violations of the FCRA, particularly sections XXXX and XXXX. Equifax 's failure to uphold these procedures and ensure compliance with the FCRA indicates a serious breach of its legal obligations. 

Lastly, according to XXXX XXXX XXXX, consumers have the right to opt out of reporting services at any time. This regulation allows consumers to exercise their rights to privacy and control over their personal information. Therefore, I hereby exercise my right to opt out of your reporting services. This notice serves as a formal declaration of my decision to revoke any and all consents, permissions, or authorizations previously given to Equifax, whether they were verbal, written, or implied. 

