9063631,2024-05-21,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Problem using a debit or ATM card,"On XX/XX/XXXX, I submitted a dispute with Navy Federal Credit Union regarding a {$150.00} purchase made through XXXX. The third-party vendor failed to fulfill the products or services. Despite numerous attempts to contact the vendor via phone and email, I received no response. Further investigation into reviews revealed numerous complaints of fraudulent practices by the vendor. Initially, the vendor had positive reviews, but I now believe these were falsified to deceive consumers. 

